<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Jasco lifts year profit, dividend held.</title>
<headline>Jasco lifts year profit, dividend held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     25.5	  vs 25.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 10.0	  vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Net asset value (cts) 131.9	 vs 116.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   9.55	  vs 7.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   13.50	 vs 11.32</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.89	  vs 3.35</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   2.87	  vs 2.56</p>
<p>    Turnover		  176.00	vs 126.66</p>
<p>Div payable May 16</p>
<p>on register May 2</p>
<p>Full name: Jasco Electronics Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was optimistic of further growth in the coming year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
